---
title: "admin_member_management (stem-system: Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_session: server action invoked
    q_check_session --> q_error_unauth: no authenticated session
    q_check_session --> q_check_admin: session valid
    q_error_unauth --> [*]: return error
    q_check_admin --> q_error_forbidden: checkAdmin() returns false (is_admin != true)
    q_check_admin --> q_determine_action: user is admin
    q_error_forbidden --> [*]: return 403 forbidden
    q_determine_action --> q_list_members: action = list
    q_determine_action --> q_update_member: action = update member fields
    q_determine_action --> q_delete_member: action = delete (logical)
    q_list_members --> [*]: return members with teams and relations (admin client)
    q_update_member --> q_validate_fields: validate update payload
    q_validate_fields --> q_error_validation: validation fails
    q_validate_fields --> q_apply_update: validation passes
    q_error_validation --> [*]: return validation error
    q_apply_update --> q_sync_roles_update: update member via admin client (bypass RLS)
    q_sync_roles_update --> [*]: fire-and-forget Discord role sync, return success
    q_delete_member --> q_set_deleted: set deleted_at = now() (logical delete, admin client)
    q_set_deleted --> [*]: return success, revalidatePath

    note right of q_check_admin
        INV-001: all admin operations require is_admin = true on the requesting user
        INV-002: admin client (service role key) bypasses RLS for all queries
    end note

    note right of q_delete_member
        INV-003: deletion is logical (deleted_at timestamp), not physical row removal
        INV-004: deleted members are preserved for data safety
    end note
